c{5}{16}r"] [:db/ensure "b66f231a-cb81-5d08-9aaf-67416d4dacc2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/id #uuid "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92"] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/choices "7a1045eb-935f-57a7-afc2-c91d4db4ea47"] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/choices "1a14329f-b839-55a3-bbfa-8a82756dfc7f"] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/choices "31664d9c-57ba-5ca3-81aa-6d5190914e33"] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/choices "c95c20c6-966a-5175-94cb-5f87e5d3b5b5"] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/choices "b66f231a-cb81-5d08-9aaf-67416d4dacc2"] [:db/add "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/correct "b66f231a-cb81-5d08-9aaf-67416d4dacc2"] [:db/ensure "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c58fe7fd-c6c3-522a-81bc-ed05e0add385" :question/id #uuid "c58fe7fd-c6c3-522a-81bc-ed05e0add385"] [:db/add "c58fe7fd-c6c3-522a-81bc-ed05e0add385" :question/problem "![](images/4f/4fd13719592a2bbd0d7983627dcae1db0530b54ba8dc976adffcb3289b6bc963.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $M$ lies on the segment $KQ$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OK}=e$ and $\\overrightarrow{OQ}=r$. The lengths satisfy $KM:MQ=5:11$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{OM}$ in terms of $e$ and $r$."] [:db/add "c58fe7fd-c6c3-522a-81bc-ed05e0add385" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OK}=e\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OQ}=r .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $K$ through $O$ to $Q$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{KQ}=\\overrightarrow{KO}+\\overrightarrow{OQ}=-e+r.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $KM:MQ=5:11$ gives $16$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{KM}=\\frac{5}{16}\\overrightarrow{KQ}=\\frac{5}{16}(-e+r).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to K\\to M$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OM}&=\\overrightarrow{OK}+\\overrightarrow{KM}\\\\&=e+\\frac{5}{16}(-e+r)\\\\&=\\frac{11}{16}e+\\frac{5}{16}r.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "c58fe7fd-c6c3-522a-81bc-ed05e0add385" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c58fe7fd-c6c3-522a-81bc-ed05e0add385" :question/answer-fields "be5c8f68-3ec5-591b-8b52-5fbab5d9eb92"] [:db/ensure "c58fe7fd-c6c3-522a-81bc-ed05e0add385" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "c58fe7fd-c6c3-522a-81bc-ed05e0add385"] [:db/ensure 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/validate]]
